<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 14.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 14.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at the Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				   Aug 14		Aug 13</p>
<p>Fed acct			  5.158		 4.678</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   17.638		17.004</p>
<p>Cash balance		   22.796		21.682</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	 5,293.858	   5,294.307</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $65 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
